[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 241.03, "timestamp": "00:04:01", "text": "フォロワーを1万人以上に増やす必要があります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 243.67, "timestamp": "00:04:03", "text": "初め。何てことだ。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.869, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "フォロワーを増やすのは簡単だ。さあ行こう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 249.35, "timestamp": "00:04:09", "text": "つまり、ある意味では、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 252.07, "timestamp": "00:04:12", "text": "よく考えてみると、支払うのは難しい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 254.07, "timestamp": "00:04:14", "text": "家賃やその他諸々を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 255.83, "timestamp": "00:04:15", "text": "ストリーミング配信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.509, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "初心者の方、またはもっと経験のある方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 259.59, "timestamp": "00:04:19", "text": "中型のストリーマーでは、うまくいきません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.15, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "ともかく。超クレイジーでなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 264.31, "timestamp": "00:04:24", "text": "人気のある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.35, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "少なくとも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.629, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "えーと、家賃を払えるようにしないと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.27, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "家賃の支払いはとても高額で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 277.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:04:37", "text": "右？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 293.159, "timestamp": "00:04:53", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "due to weather changes, I'm feeling ill and cant move much. so ill be taking rest today i might do mobile feed from bed later at night. but yea do enjoy vod relay for now. sorry for the inconveniences"}]